# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo and in working trees.
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) get CRLF while Prettier
# writes LF, so `npm run format` marks every file modified with no real change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
